      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im taking warfarin for my heart (afib) but i just started taking these really strong vitamin k supplements every morning cuz my doctor said my bone density is getting a bit low. i figured since vitamin k is good for bones it wouldnt hurt to take it, right? seems like a good way to stay healthy.",
